{"version":1,"content":"\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1024\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://hkcourtnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20261015%E5%BA%AD%E5%88%8A%EF%BD%9C%E9%87%8D%E9%BB%9E%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E9%80%9F%E8%A6%BD_01-1024x1024.png\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p>\n<p><a href=\"https://linktr.ee/hkcourtnews\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">訂閱《庭刊》</a></p>\n</p>\n<p>🔸高等法院<br/>► 1000　10庭　暫委法官祁彥輝<br/>蔡天鳳碎屍案　前夫、家翁及大伯被控謀殺等罪｜續審</p>\n<p>🔸區域法院<br/>► 1000　36庭　法官張潔宜<br/>時事評論員王岸然被控違反「23條」｜續審<br/>► 1000　7庭　法官練錦鴻<br/>西醫戴港盛涉濫發「免針紙」案｜結案陳詞<br/>► 1100　7庭　法官高勁修<br/>涉改裝紙張設計製造虛假文書　保管逾百份虛假信件　50歲男警被控10罪｜再提訊</p>\n<p>🔸西九龍法院<br/>► 0930　1庭　主任裁判官蘇文隆<br/>六旬婦涉寓所門窗展示煽動旗幟等｜續審<br/>► 0930　14庭　裁判官黃士翔<br/>港女足前助教非禮罪脫　律政司上訴得直案件發還重審｜再提堂<br/>► 1430　15庭　裁判官熊雪如<br/>巴籍男葵涌廣場指罵警員案｜裁決</p>\n<p>🔸東區法院<br/>► 1200　2庭　裁判官王證瑜<br/>懲教助理壁屋監獄外遇襲　9人被控串謀傷人等｜提訊日</p>\n<hr/>\n<p>「重點法庭案件速覽」是根據法庭日誌內，我們認為大眾會關注的翌日案件，選取出來以方便讀者閱覽</p>\n<figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://qr.payme.hsbc.com.hk/2/QrndvPxDgEi2MhNiNPz4b8\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"916\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://hkcourtnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/%E5%BA%AD%E5%88%8A%EF%BD%9CHKCourtNews_PayMe_QR_code.png\" width=\"716\"/></a></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1080\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://hkcourtnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/hkcourtnews_Octopus_QRcode_Payment_v4.png\" width=\"1080\"/></figure>\n</figure>\n<p><strong>如欲接收每日報道整合，請在訊息欄內填寫電郵地址</strong></p>\n<p></p>\n","scraped_at":"2026-10-15T07:47:39.214390+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":436,"images":3,"source":"法庭線","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"wordpress-public-posts","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-14T14:59:35+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-15T07:40:37.416994+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-15T07:40:37.416994+00:00","content_hash":"9db8bc93f8930354b8245317ebfd830aecb60b3602869d7670611f6c8adade71","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}